---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+12815550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(281) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Algae Treatment in Spring, TX | Green Pool Recovery" description="Fast algae treatment and green pool recovery in Spring, TX. Shock, brush, vacuum, and residual plan to restore clear water.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Algae Treatment</h1>
      <p>Clear green, yellow, or black algae and restore a swimmable pool.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:800px">
      <p>Algae can take over quickly in the Texas heat. We treat the bloom thoroughly, clean the surfaces, and leave a residual chlorine plan so it does not return.</p>
      <h2>Our Recovery Process</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Full water analysis and appropriate shock dosing</li>
        <li>Brushing of walls, floor, and steps</li>
        <li>Vacuuming of dead algae and debris</li>
        <li>Filter cleaning or backwash</li>
        <li>Follow-up residual and monitoring plan</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Prevention</h2>
      <p>Once clear, consistent weekly service and proper stabilizer levels dramatically reduce the chance of another bloom. We can put you on a maintenance route after recovery.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:2rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Start Algae Recovery</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
